        "calls": 2,
        "title": "Relocate code search flag parser to common, support file cwd",
        "summary": "The shared flag parser was moved from the SDK to the common package to ensure validation and process spawning use the same argv in both normal and sponsored runs. The code search tool now detects when the working directory parameter names a file and searches from that file's directory instead of failing. This file-specific search is skipped when a process broker is active to prevent unauthorized path stats in sponsored environments. Sponsored sandbox imports were updated to consume the parser from its new location in common.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "maintainers",
        "evidence": "The diff adds `parseCodeSearchFlags` to `common/src/util/code-search-flags.ts` and removes the duplicate from `sdk/src/tools/code-search.ts`; `sdk/src/tools/sponsored-sandbox.ts` updates its import to source the function from `common`.",
