        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The tool that searches your project files for text is now moved into the shared core of the application so that it behaves exactly the same in normal coding sessions and in sponsored runs. It can now search a single file directly instead of failing when told to start in a file, but only in normal sessions; sponsored runs still cannot do this to keep the advertiser's environment safe. This is internal plumbing work that makes the search more consistent and reliable, but it does not change what you see or how you use the assistant day-to-day.",
